{"at": "2026-10-08T11:49:10.164157+00:00", "event_id": "01M4DNH2WM1847A1VTKV3TX979", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M4DNGS77DS2DX1QEMX68HPT7", "final_answer": "Serveur OIDC standard derri\u00e8re une interface (v\u00e9rification des JWT par cl\u00e9s publiques, \u00e9metteur et audience configur\u00e9s) ; faux fournisseur qui signe ses jetons en test ; le jeton de rafra\u00eechissement et la connexion restent chez le serveur d'identit\u00e9 ; choix du produit diff\u00e9r\u00e9 (non bloquant, consign\u00e9). Raison : contrat humanBearer = JWT OIDC ; aucune ADR n'a choisi de produit.\r (d\u00e9cid\u00e9 par l'agent, d\u00e9l\u00e9gation du porteur du projet)", "mission_id": "01M4DNDN9WFH5S3TH3QX5TC3JS", "mission_slug": "identite-roles-double-validation-01M4DNDN", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-08T11:49:10.164157Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M4DNGS77DS2DX1QEMX68HPT7", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-08T11:49:10.158738Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
