{"at": "2026-10-08T11:49:30.464207+00:00", "event_id": "01M4DNHPQ047G3P89QHGQBDNGP", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M4DNHD2V0GAB6G8M864E82B9", "final_answer": "De la base : le sub du jeton d\u00e9signe un app_user actif ; prestataire et r\u00f4les viennent de app_user et role_assignment (retrait imm\u00e9diat d'un r\u00f4le) ; un claim operator_id diff\u00e9rent du prestataire de l'utilisateur est refus\u00e9. Raison : \u00a710.3 prestataire d\u00e9duit de l'identit\u00e9, r\u00f4le v\u00e9rifi\u00e9 pour chaque validation.\r (d\u00e9cid\u00e9 par l'agent, d\u00e9l\u00e9gation du porteur du projet)", "mission_id": "01M4DNDN9WFH5S3TH3QX5TC3JS", "mission_slug": "identite-roles-double-validation-01M4DNDN", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-08T11:49:30.464207Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M4DNHD2V0GAB6G8M864E82B9", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-08T11:49:30.460218Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
